# Google OAuth login (client-side, GSI). Copy this file to .env.local and fill in.
# When VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID is empty, login is skipped and manual entry is used
# (development default). Set a valid client ID to require login as the first step.
#
# Public Google OAuth web client ID (…apps.googleusercontent.com).
# NEVER put a client secret here — only the public web client ID.
# In Google Cloud Console, register the authorized JavaScript origins:
#   http://127.0.0.1:5173   (local development)
#   https://<your-user>.github.io   (production, GitHub Pages; HTTPS required)
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# Restrict sign-in to the school domain. Empty = allow any verified Google account.
# For Kogakuin student accounts:
VITE_ALLOWED_EMAIL_DOMAINS=g.kogakuin.jp
